      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然媽媽說過\n野生特區的寶可夢很危險……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671365ABD5ABD8AAA904E000A91CE751F7279534076845BF653EF59225F88537196AA20262026001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但如果是訓練家的寶可夢\n就沒問題了對吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
